{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":236045,\"title\":\"Paranormal Revenge\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Every episode explores two chilling stories of real-life paranormal encounters that intersect with revenge. Each story unfolds from the perspective of a main storyteller – a victim – who has been targeted by a mysterious paranormal entity or entities. What follows is a truly original and compelling approach: a mash-up of the true-crime procedural and terrifying ghost stories.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1fA7O48SsFWBlwy3um9k5E5VEXV.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3yL4rqKpwRTzx2bX1CQWrPmchUd.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7.3,\"voteCount\":3,\"year\":2023,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Mystery\",\"Reality\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":10,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"CTV Sci-Fi Channel\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CA\",\"name\":\"Canada\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2023-12-08\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":4544263,\"name\":\"Tawney Lewis\",\"character\":\"Self - Paranormal expert\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4542215,\"name\":\"Jake Estrada\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uPNvNA6mV1XyVkgGYzaz8GDegKQ.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"07poRWoYaO4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"F2AiEl0y4FA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"R1C8ygebkng\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":60918,\"title\":\"My Haunted House\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8xBCjXwsOqmOWAOVkvwr5Kqqp6P.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2962962962962963,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":62594,\"title\":\"Ghost Asylum\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/whtJmv0r58yYhbYKcZjXshlAffB.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2775757575757576,\"_genreOverlap\":2}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1fA7O48SsFWBlwy3um9k5E5VEXV.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2023-10-06\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Love You To Death/Photo Negative\",\"overview\":\"When a mom and her daughter finally escape the clutches of an abusive husband and father, he dies suddenly and comes back as a ghost.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aWRcKuEFln4QQ27HsrZDfGgtwm.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-06\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Eye On The Sky/The Creeper\",\"overview\":\"A California family man is horrified to discover that the threatening messages on his phone are coming from the other side.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rhpFIPRhapgGC1oPCMwZYhXnVEF.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-13\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Dark Pond/The Smile\",\"overview\":\"When a 7 year old girl mysteriously disappears by a remote pond in North Carolina, the life of one of her classmates is forever altered.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/75iGfbkSjdUWQAmTx7hq70nxUsA.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-20\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Bad Blood/You're Alive\",\"overview\":\"When a 7 year old boy in upstate New York is going to bed one night he is attacked by a violent ghost that has been seeking revenge on.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/plrNvW9nb4YMLWTkBT67Ri81rJK.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-27\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Dark Arts/Death Curse\",\"overview\":\"When a young Puerto Rican boy disturbs some bones buried under his house, the spirit of a headless woman starts a campaign of terror.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/75iGfbkSjdUWQAmTx7hq70nxUsA.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-03\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Pulpit Master/Scared Sick\",\"overview\":\"When a gay photography professor moves into a small North Carolina town, he encounters a ghost in his new home hell bent on torturing him.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c1i3gLKQkOSAwHwMMialWByhgLG.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-10\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"The Attachment/A Dark Past\",\"overview\":\"When a young student moves in with her boyfriend she finds a mysterious padded room in the basement and is targeted by a vengeful entity that is possessive of her boyfriend.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ZY1OMACqBeGJuVu9ojowFF005s.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-17\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Mystic Manor/Fire Fight\",\"overview\":\"When a history-loving Connecticut man and his husband buy a 200-year-old house and convert it to a B&B, they encounter a raft of spirits.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/DKuyrck8bJ7khncmpjyKAC8E0U.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-24\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"She Follows/Mind Stalker\",\"overview\":\"When a young couple with a newborn baby move into a suburb in Las Vegas, an uninvited female spirit also moves in seeking revenge for something Jonathan did years ago.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7NA1p9zcD4fqUpAVcLiqh51xLOL.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-12-01\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Lady Of The House/All Hallows\",\"overview\":\"When a woman and her husband buy a famous historical mansion in New Hampshire, they inherit a spirit along with it, and she has it out for the lady of the house.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tR1uY56TorVWN11Io3CKMCmlXb8.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-12-08\",\"runtime\":0}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2023-10-06\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}